      <link>https://www.nhpr.org/nh-news/2026-02-26/zombie-home-vacancy-rate-nh-lowest-in-america</link>
      <description>What's a zombie vacancy? It's one in which the homeowner abandons the property before a foreclosure is finalized. New Hampshire also ranked 41st in foreclosure rate.</description>
