      <title>Judge denies state request in car inspection lawsuit</title>
      <link>https://www.nhpr.org/nh-news/2026-02-26/judge-denies-nh-request-car-inspection-lawsuit</link>
      <description>Federal Judge Landya B. McCafferty denied the request from the state of New Hampshire that she stay, or suspend, her Jan. 27 preliminary injunction, which ordered the state to keep its annual car inspection program going. The state wanted her to pause her injunction pending its appeal of the order.</description>
